精确最低点在哪还是不太好找。上证指数5-6月份一笔上涨破了高点，根据广义趋势理论，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">行情上涨破高点后，下跌就不会创出新低</strong>，<span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">这个最低点理论上就是2863上方的某一个位置</strong></span>，现在距离2863还有一段距离。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5398148\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMP2u3Ve3QBKyOk8iaTwbhKc9O8dgPd6pUydw6B301sCN4gRBH5me54yuIegtvD77cmAuNWCiczCwdtA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">但是沪深300已经马上到前低了，也就是说<span style=\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);box-sizing: border-box;\">沪深300很有可能就是最低点，或非常接近最低点</span>，所以<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\">指数的重心还是要往沪深300、上证50上做</span></strong>。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6717391\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMP2u3Ve3QBKyOk8iaTwbhKc9iaibj0aX9edMhTPz5ibP3uXXte7tcw0VYnt6pficWhs04RTJLkuftWmIdg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"920\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">板块上，光伏、新能源等绝大多数赛道股都已经转成下跌趋势，光伏也反弹到了倒V型颈线，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">赛道股的方向最好别碰了</strong>。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.9380403\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMP2u3Ve3QBKyOk8iaTwbhKc9kJ8JrrjD1VM3wdwQeQpSqzP9Od1z58dp9ia9wS7XUKBel44W7XEBEkw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"694\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">而低估值方向，房地产高位下跌，目前走势转成了震荡，银行保险券商等也是底部震荡，不是上涨趋势，做中长线埋伏没问题，但<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\">短线上别抱期望太高</span></strong>。<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8579017\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMP2u3Ve3QBKyOk8iaTwbhKc9FibtwrG3rjMqPSkKkU73nQuS1boY2ibrvlBm4FXR0SP8liar3gY6bo20w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"753\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">还处在上涨趋势的，只有那么几个小众板块，比如旅游酒店、航空机场这些，但昨天放量之后也要休整一下，可以<span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">结合量价关系去高抛低吸</strong></span>。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.9258741\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMP2u3Ve3QBKyOk8iaTwbhKc9mjb8kllIvseyOx7iaeXNHRBa9VCRqcyEIvF2WfN7u0duZffiaibN2bEDg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"715\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">因为大部分赛道股还是下跌趋势，所以<span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">指数很难快速见底，或者只有低估值才能上涨</strong></span>，选错板块风险还是挺大的。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">每次底部的大体情况都差不多，但细节上又不太一样，这就是历史会重复，但不会简单的重复。我2018年是这样过来的，2020年也是这样过来的，随着时间的推移，最后都让我赚到了大钱。<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">正所谓横看成岭侧成峰，远近高低各不同，不识庐山真面目，只缘身在此山中。</strong></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin: 16px 0% 10px;font-size: 0px;display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 100 100 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"